          For items under 200-300 pounds with good access (no stairs, wide doorways), proper equipment and 2-3 strong helpers can handle it safely. For anything heavier, involving stairs, or requiring special care (pianos, antiques), professional movers provide expertise, equipment, insurance, and safety that DIY can't match.
